#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:29
msgid "Why picomatch?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:31
msgid "**Lightweight** - No dependencies"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:32
msgid ""
"**Minimal** - Tiny API surface. Main export is a function that takes a "
"glob pattern and returns a matcher function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:33
msgid ""
"**Fast** - Loads in about 2ms (that's several times faster than a [single"
" frame of a HD "
"movie](http://www.endmemo.com/sconvert/framespersecondframespermillisecond.php)"
" at 60fps)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:34
msgid ""
"**Performant** - Use the returned matcher function to speed up repeat "
"matching (like when watching files)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:35
msgid ""
"**Accurate matching** - Using wildcards (`*` and `?`), globstars (`**`) "
"for nested directories, [advanced globbing](#advanced-globbing) with "
"extglobs, braces, and POSIX brackets, and support for escaping special "
"characters with `\\` or quotes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:36
msgid "**Well tested** - Thousands of unit tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:38
msgid "See the [library comparison](#library-comparisons) to other libraries."
msgstr ""

