#: ../../source/picomatch_README.md:112
msgid ""
"Creates a matcher function from one or more glob patterns. The returned "
"function takes a string to match as its first argument, and returns true "
"if the string is a match. The returned matcher function also takes a "
"boolean as the second argument that, when true, returns an object with "
"additional information."
